      "derivedFrom": "getLogs result of the 0.0.88 all-tools smoke run (iPhone 18 Pro simulator, iOS 27.0, 2026-10-25)",
      "edits": "reconstructed from the parsed result: each line is the captured timestamp and message joined by one space",
